LPL poly6 description

  specification description
    part Vars   of sort list[identifier]
                import identifier list[identifier]
  end

  query    of sort              poly
           result of sort       pair[poly,variable]
           import               poly6[Vars]
           start with           (strat0)eval(1 + 1*X + 2*X*X + 3*X*X*X + 4*Y*Y)

end
